{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265M43rIfdsy1794199895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產太古城金星閣分行高級分行經理馬毓彬表示，分行促成太古城租賃成交，單位為富天閣高層G室，實用面積792平方呎，採3房1套間隔，向北，享單邊海景，最新以4.1萬元租出，折合實用呎租51.8元。<br/>馬毓彬表示，新租客為專業人士，心儀太古城發展成熟，且單位客廳及房間均享海景，遂決定承租。據悉，業主於2009年以818萬元購入單位，2021年曾作內部轉讓，是次出租可享6厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.626301+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:31:26.735683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.476800+00:00","content_hash":"409aadeadc7f414d7eebfdfaf21666071c6649a7186e825a019876f83c41efd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.626301+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}